---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-line mt-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-8 text-[0.9375rem] text-ink-muted">
    {/* alt="" on the daisy: it is the site mark repeated from the tab icon,
        decorative here, and naming it would only add noise before the sentence
        it sits next to. */}
    {/* No flex-wrap: the sentence is one anonymous flex item, so wrapping the
        container would drop the whole sentence below the daisy. Without it the
        text shrinks and wraps internally, keeping the daisy alongside. */}
    <p class="m-0 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-center">
      <img src="/favicon.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22" class="flex-none" />
      Happy to chat about my work and how this portfolio was made!
    </p>

    <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
      <p class="m-0">&copy; {year} Zifu Lu</p>

      <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-6 list-none m-0 p-0">
        <li>
          <a href="mailto:lzf9952@gmail.com" class="underline underline-offset-4">
            lzf9952@gmail.com
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          {/* Needs the scheme: without it the browser reads this as a relative
              path and lands on /work/www.linkedin.com/... */}
          <a
            href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/zifu-lu"
            class="underline underline-offset-4"
          >
            LinkedIn
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
